' the look of the three levels, read by PlantUML as its config before each diagram: a ring is a package, seen by its
' title alone; a module a hexagon, coloured by its ring; a type a card, coloured by its role, which the legend names;
' a story a hexagon and the platform a filled one; a payload's stream a queue; the legend a frame
skinparam ranksep 28
skinparam nodesep 20
<style>
document { Shadowing 0; FontName Helvetica }
arrow { FontSize 10; FontColor #777777; LineColor #444444; LineThickness 1.2 }
package { HorizontalAlignment center; LineColor transparent; BackgroundColor transparent; FontColor #666666; FontSize 12 }
hexagon { HorizontalAlignment center; FontStyle bold; FontSize 13; LineThickness 1.5 }
rectangle { LineColor transparent; BackgroundColor transparent }
card { RoundCorner 10; FontSize 13; LineThickness 1 }
queue { BackgroundColor #FFF6DD; LineColor #C99A2E; FontSize 13 }
frame { FontSize 10; FontColor #666666; LineColor #BBBBBB }
' the rings: driving blue, driven green, shared grey, the application and the stories teal, the domain filled
.driving { LineColor #2B6CB0; BackgroundColor #EEF4FB; FontColor #2B6CB0 }
.driven { LineColor #1F9D55; BackgroundColor #EDF8F1; FontColor #1F9D55 }
.shared { LineColor #8A8FA3; BackgroundColor #F1F2F6; FontColor #555B6E }
.application { LineColor #1F6F78; BackgroundColor #DCEBEE; FontColor #1F6F78 }
.domain { LineColor #1F6F78; BackgroundColor #1F6F78; FontColor #FFFFFF }
.story { LineColor #1F6F78; BackgroundColor #DCEBEE; FontColor #1F6F78 }
.platform { LineColor #1F6F78; BackgroundColor #1F6F78; FontColor #FFFFFF }
' the roles: a port filled in its side's colour, an adapter tinted, the domain's types white on the domain
.PrimaryAdapter { LineColor #2B6CB0; BackgroundColor #D6E6F7 }
.PrimaryPort { LineColor #2B6CB0; BackgroundColor #2B6CB0; FontColor #FFFFFF }
.SecondaryAdapter { LineColor #1F9D55; BackgroundColor #D5F0DF }
.SecondaryPort { LineColor #1F9D55; BackgroundColor #1F9D55; FontColor #FFFFFF }
.Adapter { LineColor #8A8FA3; BackgroundColor #E4E6EE }
.ValueObject { LineColor #BBBBBB; BackgroundColor #FFFFFF }
.Factory { LineColor #BBBBBB; BackgroundColor #F4F4F4 }
</style>
' the colour says the role and the ring, so their names are not written on every card
hide stereotype
